#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: emmie-connector.php
msgid "Emmie Connector"
msgstr "Emmie Connector"

#. Description of the plugin
#: emmie-connector.php
msgid ""
"Connects your website to Emmie: an intake form that adds a new client to "
"your Emmie, and Emmie's booking form for introductory meetings."
msgstr ""
"Verbindt uw website met Emmie: een aanmeldformulier dat een nieuwe cliënt in "
"uw Emmie zet, en het boekformulier van Emmie voor kennismakingsgesprekken."

#. Author of the plugin
#: emmie-connector.php
msgid "Emmie B.V."
msgstr "Emmie B.V."

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: emmie-connector.php
msgid "https://emmie.nl"
msgstr "https://emmie.nl"

#: admin-settings.php:40
msgid "Emmie API Settings"
msgstr "Emmie API Instellingen"

#: admin-settings.php:47
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "API URL"

#: admin-settings.php:55
msgid "API Token"
msgstr "API Token"

#: admin-settings.php:63
msgid "reCAPTCHA v3 Site Key"
msgstr "reCAPTCHA v3 Site Sleutel"

#: admin-settings.php:71
msgid "reCAPTCHA v3 Secret Key"
msgstr "reCAPTCHA v3 Geheime Sleutel"

#: admin-settings.php:79
msgid "Booking form"
msgstr "Boekformulier"

#: admin-settings.php:88
msgid "Neutral base style from Emmie"
msgstr "Neutrale basisopmaak van Emmie"

#: admin-settings.php:89
msgid ""
"Without it, your theme styles the booking form of [emmie_kennismaking] "
"entirely. A shortcode can choose per page with opmaak=\"basis\" or "
"opmaak=\"geen\"."
msgstr ""
"Zonder basisopmaak bepaalt uw thema hoe het boekformulier van "
"[emmie_kennismaking] eruitziet. Een shortcode kan per pagina kiezen met "
"opmaak=\"basis\" of opmaak=\"geen\"."

#: admin-settings.php:130
msgid "Configure Emmie API Connection"
msgstr "Emmie API verbinding configureren"

#: admin-settings.php:132
msgid ""
"Welcome! Please enter your Emmie API credentials to begin using the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Welkom! Vul alstublieft uw Emmie API gegevens in om de plugin te gebruiken."

#: admin-settings.php:133
msgid ""
"You can find your API credentials in your Emmie app under Settings > Inflow."
msgstr ""
"U kunt uw API gegevens vinden in uw Emmie app onder Instellingen > Instroom."

#. translators: %s: the address of the WordPress privacy settings
#: admin-settings.php:139
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The intake form links to Emmie's privacy statement, because this site has "
"none. Choose your own privacy statement under <a href=\"%s\">Settings &gt; "
"Privacy</a>: the personal data from the form are yours."
msgstr ""
"Het aanmeldformulier linkt naar de privacyverklaring van Emmie, omdat deze "
"site er geen heeft. Kies uw eigen privacyverklaring onder <a "
"href=\"%s\">Instellingen &gt; Privacy</a>: de persoonsgegevens uit het "
"formulier zijn van uw organisatie."

#: admin-settings.php:149
msgid "Save & Activate"
msgstr "Opslaan & Activeren"

#: admin-settings.php:149
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Wijzigingen Opslaan"

#: admin-settings.php:188
msgid "API URL and Token are required"
msgstr "API URL en token zijn verplicht"

#. translators: %s: the reason WordPress gives for the failed connection
#: admin-settings.php:211
#, php-format
msgid "Could not connect to the Emmie API: %s"
msgstr "Kan geen verbinding maken met de API van Emmie: %s"

#: admin-settings.php:226
msgid ""
"API token validation failed. Please check whether your API URL is correct."
msgstr ""
"Controle van het API-token mislukt. Controleer alstublieft of uw API URL "
"juist is."

#. translators: %d: the HTTP status code Emmie answered with
#: admin-settings.php:234
#, php-format
msgid "API token validation failed (HTTP %d). Please check your token."
msgstr ""
"Controle van het API-token mislukt (HTTP %d). Controleer alstublieft uw "
"token."

#: admin-settings.php:242
msgid "API token validated successfully."
msgstr "API Token succesvol gevalideerd."

#. translators: %s: a link to the page with the intake form
#: admin-settings.php:303
#, php-format
msgid ""
"API token validated successfully. The kennismaken page has been created: %s"
msgstr "API-token gecontroleerd. De pagina \"kennismaken\" is aangemaakt: %s"

#: booking-form.php:22
msgid ""
"The booking form is not shown: enter a valid Emmie API URL and token in the "
"plugin settings. Visitors see nothing here."
msgstr ""
"Het boekformulier wordt niet getoond: vul een geldige Emmie API URL en token "
"in bij de instellingen van de plugin. Bezoekers zien hier niets."

#: booking-form.php:34 form-handler.php:339
msgid "Plan an introductory meeting"
msgstr "Plan een kennismakingsgesprek"

#: emmie-connector.php:54
msgid "Deactivate"
msgstr "Deactiveren"

#: emmie-connector.php:68
msgid ""
"Do you also want to delete the settings of Emmie Connector, and move the "
"pages with its intake form to the trash?"
msgstr ""
"Wilt u ook de instellingen van Emmie Connector verwijderen, en de pagina's met "
"het aanmeldformulier naar de prullenbak verplaatsen?"

